{"id":"n47409-1-10","stage":4,"title":"덕목 · 品德","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47409-1-10-1","ko":"기독교에서 가르치는 최고의 덕목은 무엇입니까?","zh":"在基督教中，所倡导的最高美德是什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기독교에서","meaning":"基督教","explanation":"기독교：基督教；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"기독교","audio":"/audio/ffd496d8c01379824c54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32497","senseId":"1","lemma":"기독교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기독교에서","audio":"/audio/c3da3f8f7120532a809b.mp3"}},{"text":"가르치는","meaning":"教育，教导，训导","explanation":"가르치다：教育，教导，训导；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가르치다","audio":"/audio/b630a8848339bddb2b9f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62255","senseId":"5","lemma":"가르치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가르치는","audio":"/audio/5d6302ceb0c6b36cc1a1.mp3"}},{"text":"최고의","meaning":"最；最佳","explanation":"최고：最；最佳；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"최고","audio":"/audio/97b8be84b3d009c4b9b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47976","senseId":"1","lemma":"최고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"최고의","audio":"/audio/3cdaa40dd06666be2a3c.mp3"}},{"text":"덕목은","meaning":"品德","explanation":"덕목：品德；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"덕목","audio":"/audio/49cbed4ab7f3e629b75a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47409","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덕목은","audio":"/audio/ab89608050ec7c8aead9.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇입니까?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇입니까","audio":"/audio/c5857f5c5455b475904e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ffd496d8c0137982","term":"기독교","zh":"基督教","audio":"/audio/ffd496d8c01379824c54.mp3","entryId":"32497","definition":"崇拜创造天地万物的唯一之神，遵奉其子